{"nodes":[{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# Linux目录\n\n**模块说明**：Linux 文件系统、路径、权限与查询\n\n— 10 个笔记，按学习顺序排列 —","x":-110,"y":-700,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"5"},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10002","type":"file","file":"目录类型.md","x":-130,"y":-550,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10003","type":"text","text":"目录类型.md\n─────\n• 系统核心目录\n• 用户与软件相关目录\n• 目录类型说明\n• 隐藏文件与隐藏目录","x":200,"y":-550,"width":380,"height":130},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10004","type":"file","file":"目录的使用.md","x":-130,"y":-470,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10005","type":"text","text":"目录的使用.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：路径 = GPS 导航路线\n• §1 三种路径形式\n• §2 特殊路径 (.) 和 (..)\n• §3 FHS 标准\n• §4 隐藏文件与目录","x":200,"y":-470,"width":380,"height":155},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10006","type":"file","file":"Linux目录导航.md","x":-130,"y":-390,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10007","type":"text","text":"Linux目录导航.md\n─────\n• 1. pwd 打印当前工作目录\n• 2. cd 切换工作目录","x":200,"y":-390,"width":380,"height":85},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10008","type":"file","file":"目录的操作/目录的操作.md","x":-130,"y":-310,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10009","type":"text","text":"目录的操作.md\n─────\n• 0 写在前面：所有操作统一心智模型\n• 1 概念基础：操作对象到底是什么\n• 2 创建/复制/移动/链接/删除命令\n• 3 面试追问与速查","x":200,"y":-310,"width":380,"height":130},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f1000a","type":"file","file":"目录的权限.md","x":-130,"y":-230,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f1000b","type":"text","text":"目录的权限.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：图书馆比喻\n• §1 为什么目录权限要单独讲\n• §2 基础权限模型 UGO + rwx","x":200,"y":-230,"width":380,"height":110},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f1000c","type":"file","file":"linux文件查询.md","x":-130,"y":-150,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f1000d","type":"text","text":"linux文件查询.md\n─────\n• 1. ls 列目录\n• 2. cat / less / head / tail\n• 3. file 识别文件类型\n• 4. stat 元数据\n• 5. 三种时间戳 access/modify/change\n• 6. find 按条件查找\n• 7. locate 快速查找","x":200,"y":-150,"width":380,"height":200},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f1000e","type":"file","file":"Linux vfs虚拟文件系统.md","x":-130,"y":-70,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f1000f","type":"text","text":"Linux vfs虚拟文件系统.md\n─────\n• 0 为什么要 VFS\n• 1 四个核心对象 (super_block / inode / dentry / file)\n• 2 路径解析与 RCU walk\n• 3 dcache / page cache 性能\n• 4 VFS 与命令的精确映射","x":200,"y":-70,"width":380,"height":155},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10010","type":"file","file":"VFS-四个核心对象辨析.md","x":-130,"y":10,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10011","type":"text","text":"VFS-四个核心对象辨析.md\n─────\n• 1 逻辑链串讲\n• 2 六个最容易混淆的点\n• 3 一句总结\n• 相关笔记","x":200,"y":10,"width":380,"height":130},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10012","type":"file","file":"VFS-page-cache深度解析.md","x":-130,"y":90,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10013","type":"text","text":"VFS-page-cache深度解析.md\n─────\n• 1 概念全景图\n• 2 三个核心概念 (address_space / struct page / LRU)\n• 3 一次 read() 的精细流程","x":200,"y":90,"width":380,"height":110},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10014","type":"file","file":"VFS-rm与inode引用计数.md","x":-130,"y":170,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a1b1c1d1e1f10015","type":"text","text":"VFS-rm与inode引用计数.md\n─────\n• 1 rm 到底干了啥\n• 2 inode 的两个引用计数\n• 3 一句话精准版\n• 4 场景验证\n• 5 常见怪现象的解释","x":200,"y":170,"width":380,"height":155}],"edges":[{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10001","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10002","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10003","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10003","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10004","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10004","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10004","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10005","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10005","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10006","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10006","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10006","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10007","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10007","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10006","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f10008","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e1b1c1d1e1f10008","fromNode":"a1b1c1d1e1f100